-- Frost Mage rework - talent tree content, reuse/retune pass (docs/frost-mage-talent-tree-content-handoff.md
-- "Suggested order" step 2, partial): Improved Blizzard (63) and Frost Warding (70, rank 2 capstone).
--
-- Improved Blizzard: added mana-cost% (SPELLMOD_COST) and periodic-interval% (SPELLMOD_ACTIVATION_TIME,
-- which drives AuraEffect tick amplitude - see SpellAuraEffects.cpp:646) effects, both Blizzard-scoped
-- (SpellClassMask 524416) and new relative to the pulled stock spell, which only ever carried the
-- chill-on-Blizzard OVERRIDE_CLASS_SCRIPTS effect (left untouched).
--
-- Frost Warding: base effects (armor/resist %, ward-negate-chance %) already matched the redesign
-- spec's numbers exactly as pulled - no change. Added the capstone as a rank-2-only SPELL_AURA_DUMMY
-- (EFFECT_2, SpellIconID 501); paired with a live check in Unit::MeleeDamageBonusTaken (same commit)
-- rather than a static SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_TAKEN, so "-20% physical damage taken while Frost
-- Armor or Ice Armor is active" can't go stale between armor swaps.

DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (11185, 12487, 12488, 28332);
